><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house." width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Make Evri your trusted parcel carrier</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->When comparing Evri vs Royal Mail, it comes down to three key things - price, features, and track record. Royal Mail might have been delivering for longer but our flexible and innovative approach brings parcel sending into the modern day - making it easy and cost-effective for our customers. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Whether you’re sending a gift to a friend, multiple marketplace orders, or managing bulk shipments overseas, our services evolve and scale around your needs.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Send a parcel" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/send" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Send a parcel<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="always-cheaper-than-royal-mail" class="pricing-table" index="2" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__container" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__content" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="reusable-table__wrapper" data-v-ae5ccddd data-v-0e99fcf9><table class="reusable-table__table reusable-table__table--rightmost-col-blue" data-v-0e99fcf9><thead class="reusable-table__titles" data-v-0e99fcf9><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Weight</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Royal Mail</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Evri</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Saving*</th><!--]--></tr></thead><tbody class="reusable-table__data" data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Postable</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£2.85</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£2.70</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.15</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>0-1kg Small</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.65</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.04</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.61</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>0-1kg Standard</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£5.55</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.29</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£2.26</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>1-2kg Small</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.65</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.52</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.13</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>1-2kg Standard</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£5.55</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.79</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.76</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>2-5kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.35</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£6.59</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.76</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>5-10kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.35</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£6.68</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.67</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>10-15kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£11.85</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£10.28</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£1.57</td><!--]--></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="pricing-table__description" data-v-ae5ccddd>*Royal Mail prices quoted are for a small UK tracked 48-hour delivery vs. Evri small (measuring up to 45cm x 35cm x 16cm) and standard parcel services, as well as Postable (1kg), which is compared to a Royal Mail Large Letter (1kg) sold via Royal Mail Click &amp; Drop. Quoted prices are to UK locations that don’t incur a location charge. Prices compared at https://www.royalmail.com/sites/royalmail.com/files/2026-06/online-price-guide-july-2026-v2.pdf on 01/07/2026. Summer Sale ends 31/8/2026. Different terms and conditions will apply to each service.</p></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section" data-v-ae5ccddd><!----><h2 class="pricing-table__save-section-title" data-v-ae5ccddd>Always cheaper than Royal Mail</h2><div class="pricing-table__save-section-subheader" data-v-ae5ccddd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At Evri, we’ll always aim to give you the best prices to post a parcel. We price parcels by weight so you can save by providing the exact weight of your parcel. Our flexible pricing makes sending parcels simpler for both you and us too! Compare Evri vs Royal Mail UK prices:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section-buttons-container" data-v-ae5ccddd><!----><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link pricing-table__save-section-button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/send" data-v-ae5ccddd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send a parcel<!--]--></span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="evri-next-day-is-cheaper-than-royal-mail" class="pricing-table" index="3" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__container" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__content" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="reusable-table__wrapper" data-v-ae5ccddd data-v-0e99fcf9><table class="reusable-table__table reusable-table__table--rightmost-col-blue" data-v-0e99fcf9><thead class="reusable-table__titles" data-v-0e99fcf9><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Weight</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Royal Mail</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Evri</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Saving*</th><!--]--></tr></thead><tbody class="reusable-table__data" data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Postable</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.80</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.49</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.31</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>0-1kg Small</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.65</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.90</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.75</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>0-1kg Standard</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£6.55</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.12</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.53</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>1-2kg Small</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.65</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£4.60</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.05</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>1-2kg Standard</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£6.55</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£5.48</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>-£0.83</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>2-5kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£8.55</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.55</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£1.00</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>5-10kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£8.55</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.72</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.83</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>10-15kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£13.85</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£12.35</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£1.50</td><!--]--></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="pricing-table__description" data-v-ae5ccddd>*Royal Mail prices quoted are for a small UK tracked 24-hour delivery vs. Evri small (measuring up to 45cm x 35cm x 16cm) and standard Next Day parcel services, as well as Postable (1kg), which is compared to a Royal Mail Large Letter (1kg) sold via Royal Mail Click &amp; Drop. Quoted prices are to UK locations that don’t incur a location charge. Prices compared at https://www.royalmail.com/sites/royalmail.com/files/2026-06/online-price-guide-july-2026-v2.pdf on 01/07/2026. Summer Sale ends 31/8/2026. Different terms and conditions will apply to each service.</p></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section" data-v-ae5ccddd><!----><h2 class="pricing-table__save-section-title" data-v-ae5ccddd>Evri Next Day is cheaper than Royal Mail</h2><div class="pricing-table__save-section-subheader" data-v-ae5ccddd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Need to get your parcel there faster? We can help. So long as you drop your parcel off before 12pm, our couriers will deliver to your recipient the next working day.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our Next Day service is fast, easy to use and includes all of the great benefits of our Standard delivery service. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Save even more when you send to a ParcelShop – it’s our cheapest way to send! See <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/our-prices" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->our prices <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->to learn more.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section-buttons-container" data-v-ae5ccddd><!----><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link pricing-table__save-section-button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/our-services/next-day-parcel-delivery" data-v-ae5ccddd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send Next Day<!--]--></span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="are-you-vat-registered?" data-slice="FeatureBanner" class="feature-banner feature-banner--pt-0 feature-banner--pb-0" index="4" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__container" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__content" data-v-054940bd><!----><h2 class="feature-banner__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-054940bd>Are you VAT registered?</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="feature-banner__image" data-v-054940bd><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z0XERq8jQArT1Upa_Womensendinglotsofparcelsc413.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z0XERq8jQArT1Upa_Womensendinglotsofparcels.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z0XERq8jQArT1Upa_Womensendinglotsofparcels.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z0XERq8jQArT1Upa_Womensendinglotsofparcels.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-054940bd></div><!----></div></section><section id="compare-international-services" class="pricing-table" index="5" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__container" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__content" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="reusable-table__wrapper" data-v-ae5ccddd data-v-0e99fcf9><table class="reusable-table__table reusable-table__table--rightmost-col-blue" data-v-0e99fcf9><thead class="reusable-table__titles" data-v-0e99fcf9><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Country</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Royal Mail</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Evri</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Saving*</th><!--]--></tr></thead><tbody class="reusable-table__data" data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>USA</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£17.53</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£15.79</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£1.74</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Australia</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£19.40</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£15.69</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.71</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Canada</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£20.27</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£18.19</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£2.08</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>France</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£11.15</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£8.99</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£2.16</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Germany</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£9.95</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£8.29</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£1.66</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Ireland</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£8.80</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.89</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£0.91</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Italy</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£11.90</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£10.69</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£1.21</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Netherlands</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£10.85</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£7.69</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£3.16</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>New Zealand</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£20.25</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£18.19</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£2.06</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Spain</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£11.40</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£10.29</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£1.11</td><!--]--></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="pricing-table__description" data-v-ae5ccddd>*Royal Mail prices quoted are for an International Tracked delivery of a small 1kg parcel to the destination country vs a tracked Evri parcel of the same weight. Prices compared at https://www.royalmail.com/prices2026 on 14/05/2026. Other features of the services, including transit times and compensation levels, will differ. Different terms and conditions will apply.</p></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section" data-v-ae5ccddd><!----><h2 class="pricing-table__save-section-title" data-v-ae5ccddd>Compare international services</h2><div class="pricing-table__save-section-subheader" data-v-ae5ccddd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Sending a parcel to <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/international-courier-services/europe" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Europe<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/international-courier-services/north-america" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->North America<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, or further afield? We also offer a low-cost, international shipping service with end-to-end tracking, delivering to 200+ countries and territories worldwide - starting at just £6.08. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out Evri vs Royal Mail international prices to save you more when you send with us. Our low prices and easy marketplace integrations make sending your parcels cheaper and completely hassle-free.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section-buttons-container" data-v-ae5ccddd><!----><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link pricing-table__save-section-button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/international-send" data-v-ae5ccddd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send an international parcel<!--]--></span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="send-a-parcel-with-evri-vs-royal-mail" class="section-wrapper information-table" index="6" data-v-d2116e83 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 class="information-table__title" data-v-d2116e83>Send a parcel with Evri vs Royal Mail</h2><p class="information-table__subtitle" data-v-d2116e83>Sending a parcel with Evri has never been easier! We offer three simple ways to post your package when you choose from one of our 10,000+ drop-off ParcelShops and Lockers or Courier collection service. Book a delivery online at your convenience for a speedy send using our website or App.

For every parcel travelling through our network, we include full tracking, up to £20 free cover, and delivery options - even when you select our Standard Delivery service. No matter where you&#39;re sending your parcel from, your recipient can keep up with its progress and choose the best way to receive their package.

See what benefits you can get with Evri vs Royal Mail in the UK.</p><div class="information-table__wrap" data-v-d2116e83><table class="information-table__element" data-v-d2116e83><thead class="information-table__table-header" data-v-d2116e83><tr data-v-d2116e83><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Feature</th><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Royal Mail</th><th class="information-table__column-header" data-v-d2116e83>Evri</th></tr></thead><tbody data-v-d2116e83><!--[--><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Feature</span><span data-v-d2116e83>End-to-end tracking</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Royal Mail</span><span data-v-d2116e83>✓</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Evri</span><span data-v-d2116e83>✓</span></td></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Feature</span><span data-v-d2116e83>1-hour delivery &amp; collection window</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Royal Mail</span><span data-v-d2116e83>✘</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Evri</span><span data-v-d2116e83>✓</span></td></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Feature</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Signature</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Royal Mail</span><span data-v-d2116e83>£1.60</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Evri</span><span data-v-d2116e83>60p</span></td></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Feature</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Parcel cover</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Royal Mail</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Free up to £75</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Evri</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Free up to £20, options to increase up to £999</span></td></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Feature</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Number of delivery attempts</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Royal Mail</span><span data-v-d2116e83>2</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Evri</span><span data-v-d2116e83>3</span></td></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Feature</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Parcel dimensions (cm)</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Royal Mail</span><span data-v-d2116e83>61 x 46 x 46 (Medium) or 45 x 35 x 16 (Small)</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Evri</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Max. 120 length or up to 245 circumference</span></td></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Feature</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Free UK label printing</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Royal Mail</span><span data-v-d2116e83>✓</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Evri</span><span data-v-d2116e83>✓</span></td></tr><tr class="information-table__row" data-v-d2116e83><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Feature</span><span data-v-d2116e83>Trustpilot rating</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Royal Mail</span><span data-v-d2116e83>1.4</span></td><td class="information-table__cell" data-v-d2116e83><span class="information-table__cell-header" data-v-d2116e83>Evri</span><span data-v-d2116e83>4.1</span></td></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="information-table__table-footer" data-v-d2116e83><small data-v-d2116e83>Royal Mail features quoted are for Royal Mail UK &quot;Tracked 48&quot; parcels vs. Evri standard parcels. Compared on 07/04/2026. Different terms and conditions will apply to each service.</small></p><div class="information-table__footer-button-wrap" data-v-d2116e83><!----></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="evri-vs-royal-mail-on-sustainability" class="section-wrapper" index="7" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/17b29b34-40b4-43a9-b43a-5867cd4848fd_ESG%2bVana942.png') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/17b29b34-40b4-43a9-b43a-5867cd4848fd_ESG+Van.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/17b29b34-40b4-43a9-b43a-5867cd4848fd_ESG+Van.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/17b29b34-40b4-43a9-b43a-5867cd4848fd_ESG+Van.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="612" height="345" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Evri vs Royal Mail on Sustainability</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->When it comes to sustainability, Evri is miles ahead in its journey. As a responsible carrier, we’ve set huge targets to become ESG leaders in our industry - and we’re certainly on track. With award-winning sustainability solutions proudly to our name and aims for net-zero carbon emissions by 2035, our goal is a decade ahead of Royal Mail’s. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We’re also heavily investing in expanding our sustainable fleet, including bio-CNG, HVO, and electric vehicles as well as implementing innovations for eco-friendly hubs and alternative fuel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our commitment to sustainability doesn’t just stop with the environment - we’re prioritising governance improvements across the business and social initiatives beyond as well to build a better future for all.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->See how Evri is leading sustainability, or discover how <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/evri-vs-yodel" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri vs Yodel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> compares.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Find out more" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/environment-social-and-governance/environment" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Find out more<!--]--></span></a><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div 