<div class="faqs-content" data-v-6bee4b86><h2 class="faqs-title" data-v-6bee4b86>Frequently asked questions</h2><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canilinkmymarketplaceaccounttoevri-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canilinkmymarketplaceaccounttoevri" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canilinkmymarketplaceaccounttoevri" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I link my marketplace account to Evri?-open answer" data-test-id="canilinkmymarketplaceaccounttoevri-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canilinkmymarketplaceaccounttoevri-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I link my marketplace account to Evri?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canilinkmymarketplaceaccounttoevri" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canilinkmymarketplaceaccounttoevri" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canilinkmymarketplaceaccounttoevri-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Yes - you can manage multiple marketplace orders and larger volumes all in one place using our simple <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/customer/bulk-upload" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->bulk integration tool<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. Evri makes it easy to link your eBay, Amazon, Etsy, and Shopify accounts to save you time and money. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Follow the steps in our guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/bulk-send" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to send multiple parcels and connect your Evri account<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canevrideliverinternationalparcels-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canevrideliverinternationalparcels" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canevrideliverinternationalparcels" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can Evri deliver international parcels?-open answer" data-test-id="canevrideliverinternationalparcels-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canevrideliverinternationalparcels-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can Evri deliver international parcels?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="