r end-to-end tracking and options to divert your delivery. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Simply enter your tracking number on our <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/track-a-parcel" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->tracking page<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to see where your parcel is on its journey.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canibuycoverformyparcel" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canibuycoverformyparcel" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I buy cover for my parcel?-open answer" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I buy cover for my parcel?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canibuycoverformyparcel" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canibuycoverformyparcel" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canibuycoverformyparcel-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We offer free cover up to £20 on most items to keep your parcels protected every step of the way. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Unlike Royal Mail, you can scale your cover to your needs with Evri and up to the value of £999 - starting from just 1p extra. For more information, see our guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/parcel-cover" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->parcel cover<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Restricted items and <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/our-services/postable" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Postable parcels<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> aren’t covered. Check our <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/send/what-i-can-and-cannot-send" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->non-compensation list<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->for a full breakdown of what these include.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whatisthecheapestwaytosendaparcelintheukwithevri-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatisthecheapestwaytosendaparcelintheukwithevri" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatisthecheapestwaytosendaparcelintheukwithevri" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-What is the cheapest way to send a parcel in the UK with Evri?-open answer" data-test-id="whatisthecheapestwaytosendaparcelintheukwithevri-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatisthecheapestwaytosendaparcelintheukwithevri-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What is the cheapest way to send a parcel in the UK with Evri?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatisthecheapestwaytosendaparcelintheukwithevri" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatisthecheapestwaytosendaparcelintheukwithevri" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatisthecheapestwaytosendaparcelintheukwithevri-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The cheapest way to send a parcel in the UK is via ParcelShop-to-ParcelShop, rather than arranging a collection or home delivery. Sending from ParcelShop to ParcelShop helps keep costs lower. Evri’s ParcelShop delivery starts from just a few pounds for small parcels, making it one of the most cost-effective options.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="isevripartofroyalmail-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-isevripartofroyalmail" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-isevripartofroyalmail" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Is Evri part of Royal Mail?-open answer" data-test-id="isevripartofroyalmail-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="isevripartofroyalmail-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Is Evri part of Royal Mail?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-isevripartofroyalmail" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-isevripartofroyalmail" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="isevripartofroyalmail-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[-->