9","£2.26",{"column_1_cell":99,"column_2_cell":90,"column_3_cell":100,"column_4_cell":101},"1-2kg Small","£3.52","£0.13",{"column_1_cell":103,"column_2_cell":95,"column_3_cell":104,"column_4_cell":105},"1-2kg Standard","£4.79","£0.76",{"column_1_cell":107,"column_2_cell":108,"column_3_cell":109,"column_4_cell":105},"2-5kg","£7.35","£6.59",{"column_1_cell":111,"column_2_cell":108,"column_3_cell":112,"column_4_cell":113},"5-10kg","£6.68","£0.67",{"column_1_cell":115,"column_2_cell":116,"column_3_cell":117,"column_4_cell":118},"10-15kg","£11.85","£10.28","£1.57",{"PricingTableImage":120,"PricingTableHeader":121,"PricingTableText":122,"PricingTableButtonText":74,"PricingTableButtonUrl":126,"scrollDown":21,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonText":45,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonUrl":128,"buttonGtmTrack":45,"PricingTableDescription":130,"table_header_row_blue":21,"table_rightmost_column_blue":39,"column_name_1":131,"column_name_2":132,"column_name_3":133,"column_name_4":134},{},"Always cheaper than Royal Mail",[123],{"type":67,"text":124,"spans":125},"At Evri, we’ll always aim to give you the best prices to post a parcel. We price parcels by weight so you can save by providing the exact weight of your parcel. Our flexible pricing makes sending parcels simpler for both you and us too! Compare Evri vs Royal Mail UK prices:",[],{"link_type":76,"key":127,"url":78},"9b88e49f-6e97-440a-aae9-b4232aa44f14",{"link_type":76,"key":129,"url":78},"ed3c044e-b950-40f2-90b7-a27e857de889","*Royal Mail prices quoted are for a small UK tracked 48-hour delivery vs. Evri small (measuring up to 45cm x 35cm x 16cm) and standard parcel services, as well as Postable (1kg), which is compared to a Royal Mail Large Letter (1kg) sold via Royal Mail Click & Drop. Quoted prices are to UK locations that don’t incur a location charge. Prices compared at https:\u002F\u002Fwww.royalmail.com\u002Fsites\u002Froyalmail.com\u002Ffiles\u002F2026-06\u002Fonline-price-guide-july-2026-v2.pdf on 01\u002F07\u002F2026. Summer Sale ends 31\u002F8\u002F2026. Different terms and conditions will apply to each service.","Weight","Royal Mail","Evri","Saving*","pricing_table_v2$069533ce-edcd-4013-9525-af0809a5e2b1","pricing_table_v2",{"variation":47,"version":26,"items":138,"primary":168,"id":198,"slice_type":136,"slice_label":45},[139,143,147,151,154,157,161,164],{"column_1_cell":84,"column_2_cell":140,"column_3_cell":141,"column_4_cell":142},"£3.80","£3.49","£0.31",{"column_1_cell":89,"column_2_cell":144,"column_3_cell":145,"column_4_cell":146},"£4.65","£3.90","£0.75",{"column_1_cell":94,"column_2_cell":148,"column_3_cell":149,"column_4_cell":150},"£6.55","£4.12","£0.53",{"column_1_cell":99,"column_2_cell":144,"column_3_cell":152,"column_4_cell":153},"£4.60","£0.05",{"column_1_cell":103,"column_2_cell":148,"column_3_cell":155,"column_4_cell":156},"£5.48","-£0.83",{"column_1_cell":107,"column_2_cell":158,"column_3_cell":159,"column_4_cell":160},"£8.55","£7.55","£1.00",{"column_1_cell":111,"column_2_cell":158,"column_3_cell":162,"column_4_cell":163},"£7.72","£0.83",{"column_1_cell":115,"column_2_cell":165,"column_3_cell":166,"column_4_cell":167},"£13.85","£12.35","£1.50",{"PricingTableImage":169,"PricingTableHeader":170,"PricingTableText":171,"PricingTableButtonText":191,"PricingTableButtonUrl":192,"scrollDown":21,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonText":45,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonUrl":195,"buttonGtmTrack":45,"PricingTableDescription":197,"table_header_row_blue":21,"table_rightmost_column_blue":39,"column_name_1":131,"column_name_2":132,"column_name_3":133,"column_name_4":134},{},"Evri Next Day is cheaper than Royal Mail",[172,175,178],{"type":67,"text":173,"spans":174,"direction":70},"Need to get your parcel there faster? We can help. So long as you drop your parcel off before 12pm, our couriers will deliver to your recipient the next working day.",[],{"type":67,"text":176,"spans":177,"direction":70},"Our Next Day service is fast, easy to use and includes all of the great benefits of our Standard delivery service. ",[],{"type":67,"text":179,"spans":180,"direction":70},"Save even more when you send to a ParcelShop – it’s our cheapest way to send! See our prices to learn more.",[181,184],{"start":59,"end":182,"type":183},107,"strong",{"start":185,"end":186,"type":187,"data":188},82,93,"hyperlink",{"link_type":76,"url":189,"target":190},"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Four-prices","_blank","Send Next Day",{"link_type":76,"key":193,"url":194},"cf9cbe88-c559-4ab9-80b1-96da60d16a09","evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fnext-day-parcel-delivery",{"link_type":196},"Any","*Royal Mail prices quoted are for a small UK tracked 24-hour delivery vs. Evri small (measuring up to 45cm x 35cm x 16cm) and standard Next Day parcel services, as well as Postable (1kg), which is compared to a Royal Mail Large Letter (1kg) sold via Royal Mail Click & Drop. Quoted prices are to UK locations that don’t incur a location charge. Prices compared at https:\u002F\u002Fwww.royalmail.com\u002Fsites\u002Froyalmail.com\u002Ffiles\u002F2026-06\u002Fonline-price-guide-july-2026-v2.pdf on 01\u002F07\u002F2026. Summer Sale ends 31\u002F8\u002F2026. Different terms and conditions will apply to each service.","pricing_table_v2$9c13be40-750d-4ca5-886e-26cc4f1a3477",{"variation":47,"version":26,"items":200,"primary":201,"id":215,"slice_type":216,"slice_label":45},[],{"title":202,"bodyText":203,"isEco":21,"PaddingTop":21,"PaddingBottom":21,"NoMarginBottom":21,"hasButton":21,"buttonText":45,"buttonLink":207,"image":208},"Are you VAT registered?",[204],{"type":67,"text":205,"spans":206,"direction":70},"Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!",[],{"link_type":196},{"dimensions":209,"alt":45,"copyright":45,"url":211,"id":212,"edit":213},{"width":53,"height":210},667,"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ0XERq8jQArT1Upa_Womensendinglotsofparcels.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&w=1000&h=667","Z0XERq8jQArT1Upa",{"x":214,"y":59,"zoom":61,"background":62},2,"feature_banner$4806413d-898a-412a-bffc-df7b294d5410","feature_banner",{"variation":47,"version":26,"items":218,"primary":268,"id":297,"slice_type":136,"slice_label":45},[219,224,229,234,239,244,249,254,259,263],{"column_1_cell":220,"column_2_cell":221,"column_3_cell":222,"column_4_cell":223},"USA","£17.53","£15.79","£1.74",{"column_1_cell":225,"column_2_cell":226,"column_3_cell":227,"column_4_cell":228},"Australia","£19.40","£15.69","£3.71",{"column_1_cell":230,"column_2_cell":231,"column_3_cell":232,"column_4_cell":233},"Canada","£20.27","£18.19","£2.08",{"column_1_cell":235,"column_2_cell":236,"column_3_cell":237,"column_4_cell":238},"France","£11.15","£8.99","£2.16",{"column_1_cell":240,"column_2_cell":241,"column_3_cell":242,"column_4_cell":243},"Germany","£9.95","£8.29","£1.66",{"column_1_cell":245,"column_2_cell":246,"column_3_cell":247,"column_4_cell":248},"Ireland","£8.80","£7.89","£0.91",{"column_1_cell":250,"column_2_cell":251,"column_3_cell":252,"column_4_cell":253},"Italy","£11.90","£10.69","£1.21",{"column_1_cell":255,"column_2_cell":256,"column_3_cell":257,"column_4_cell":258},"Netherlands","£10.85","£7.69","£3.16",{"column_1_cell":260,"column_2_cell":261,"column_3_cell":232,"column_4_cell":262},"New Zealand","£20.25","£2.06",{"column_1_cell":264,"column_2_cell":265,"column_3_cell":266,"column_4_cell":267},"Spain","£11.40","£10.29","£1.11",{"PricingTableImage":269,"PricingTableHeader":270,"PricingTableText":271,"PricingTableButtonText":290,"PricingTableButtonUrl":291,"scrollDown":21,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonText":45,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonUrl":294,"buttonGtmTrack":45,"PricingTableDescription":295,"table_header_row_blue":21,"table_rightmost_column_blue":39,"column_name_1":296,"column_name_2":132,"column_name_3":133,"column_name_4":134},{},"Compare international services",[272,287],{"type":67,"text":273,"spans":274,"direction":70},"Sending a parcel to Europe, North America, or further afield? We also offer a low-cost, international shipping service with end-to-end tracking, delivering to 200+ countries and territories worldwide - starting at just £6.08. ",[275,280,281,286],{"start":276,"end":277,"type":187,"data":278},20,26,{"link_type":76,"url":279,"target":190},"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Feurope",{"start":276,"end":277,"type":183},{"start":282,"end":283,"type":187,"data":284},28,41,{"link_type":76,"url":285,"target":190},"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fnorth-america",{"start":282,"end":283,"type":183},{"type":67,"text":288,"spans":289,"direction":70},"Check out Evri vs Royal Mail international prices to save you more when you send with us. Our low prices and easy marketplace integrations make sending your parcels cheaper and completely hassle-free.",[],"Send an international parcel",{"link_type":76,"key":292,"url":293},"d8473c1f-28d1-491b-aa04-11402013dd6f","evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send",{"link_type":196},"*Royal Mail prices quoted are for an International Tracked delivery of a small 1kg parcel to the destination country vs a tracked Evri parcel of the same weight. Prices compared at https:\u002F\u002Fwww.royalmail.com\u002Fprices2026 on 14\u002F05\u002F2026. Other features of the services, including transit times and compensation levels, will differ. Different terms and conditions will apply.","Country","pricing_table_v2$401562ef-4520-47b6-a840-62c3f28dcd1c",{"variation":299,"version":26,"items":300,"primary":329,"id":334,"slice_type":335,"slice_label":45},"3ColumnTable",[301,304,307,311,315,319,323,325],{"Col1Content":302,"Col2Content":303,"Col3Content":303},"End-to-end tracking","✓",{"Col1Content":305,"Col2Content":306,"Col3Content":303},"1-hour delivery & collection window","✘",{"Col1Content":308,"Col2Content":309,"Col3Content":310},"Signature","£1.60","60p",{"Col1Content":312,"Col2Content":313,"Col3Content":314},"Parcel cover","Free up to £75","Free up to £20, options to increase up to £999",{"Col1Content":316,"Col2Content":317,"Col3Content":318},"Number of delivery attempts","2","3",{"Col1Content":320,"Col2Content":321,"Col3Content":322},"Parcel dimensions (cm)","61 x 46 x 46 (Medium) or 45 x 35 x 16 (Small)","Max. 120 length or up to 245 circumference",{"Col1Content":324,"Col2Content":303,"Col3Content":303},"Free UK label printing",{"Col1Content":326,"Col2Content":327,"Col3Content":328},"Trustpilot rating","1.4","4.1",{"SectionTitle":330,"SectionSubtitle":331,"Col1Header":332,"Col2Header":132,"Col3Header":133,"TableFooter":333,"isTableShort":21},"Send a parcel with Evri vs Royal Mail","Sending a parcel with Evri has never been easier! We offer three simple ways to post your package when you choose from one of our 10,000+ drop-off ParcelShops and Lockers or Courier collection service. Book a delivery online at your convenience for a speedy send using our website or App.\n\nFor every parcel travelling through our network, we include full tracking, up to £20 free cover, and delivery options - even when you select our Standard Delivery service. No matter where you're sending your parcel from, your recipient can keep up with its progress and choose the best way to receive their package.\n\nSee what benefits you can get with Evri vs Royal Mail in the UK.","Feature","Royal Mail features quoted are for Royal Mail UK \"Tracked 48\" parcels vs. Evri standard parcels. Compared on 07\u002F04\u002F2026. Different terms and conditions will apply to each service.","information_table$fa8f4a1c-f07d-4ff3-bee2-dc08f72b34e0","information_table",{"variation":47,"version":26,"items":337,"primary":339,"id":372,"slice_type":80,"slice_label":45},[338],{},{"CardImage":340,"CardAvatar":63,"CardTitle":347,"CardText":348,"ButtonText":368,"ButtonUrl":369,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":341,"alt":45,"copyright":45,"url":344,"id":345,"edit":346},{"width":342,"height":343},612,345,"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F17b29b34-40b4-43a9-b43a-5867cd4848fd_ESG+Van.png?auto=compress,format","ZRRCXBQAACYAtkXm",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":61,"background":62},"Evri vs Royal Mail on Sustainability",[349,352,355,358],{"type":67,"text":350,"spans":351,"direction":70},"When it comes to sustainability, Evri is miles ahead in its journey. As a responsible carrier, we’ve set huge targets to become ESG leaders in our industry - and we’re certainly on track. With award-winning sustainability solutions proudly to our name and aims for net-zero carbon emissions by 2035, our goal is a decade ahead of Royal Mail’s. ",[],{"type":67,"text":353,"spans":354,"direction":70},"We’re also heavily investing in expanding our sustainable fleet, including bio-CNG, HVO, and electric vehicles as well as implementing innovations for eco-friendly hubs and alternative fuel.",[],{"type":67,"text":356,"spans":357,"direction":70},"Our commitment to sustainability doesn’t just stop with the environment - we’re prioritising governance improvements across the business and social initiatives beyond as well to build a better future for all.",[],{"type":67,"text":359,"spans":360,"direction":70},"See how Evri is leading sustainability, or discover how Evri vs Yodel compares.",[361,367],{"start":362,"end":363,"type":187,"data":364},56,69,{"link_type":76,"url":365,"target":366},"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fevri-vs-yodel","_self",{"start":362,"end":363,"type":183},"Find out more",{"link_type":76,"key":370,"url":371},"0e5a86bf-176b-4666-a458-b358b102dea0","evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fenvironment-social-and-governance\u002Fenvironment","card$f7152e63-aee9-4070-bb6f-a5883e53b91b",{"variation":47,"version":26,"items":374,"primary":482,"id":484,"slice_type":485,"slice_label":45},[375,396,416,433,464,470,476],{"questionTitle":376,"questionBody":377},"Can I link my marketplace account to Evri?",[378,387],{"type":67,"text":379,"spans":380,"direction":70},"Yes - you can manage multiple marketplace orders and larger volumes all in one place using our simple bulk integration tool. Evri makes it easy to link your eBay, Amazon, Etsy, and Shopify accounts to save you time and money. ",[381,386],{"start":382,"end":383,"type":187,"data":384},102,123,{"link_type":76,"url":385,"target":190},"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcustomer\u002Fbulk-upload",{"start":382,"end":383,"type":183},{"type":67,"text":388,"spans":389,"direction":70},"Follow the steps in our guide on how to send multiple parcels and connect your Evri account.",[390,395],{"start":391,"end":392,"type":187,"data":393},33,91,{"link_type":76,"url":394,"target":190},"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fbulk-send",{"start":391,"end":392,"type":183},{"questionTitle":397,"questionBody":398},"Can Evri deliver international parcels?",[399,407],{"type":67,"text":400,"spans":401,"direction":70},"Yes - whether you’re sending parcels all over the UK, across Europe or to distant continents, our network gives you global coverage to get your package from A to anywhere. ",[402,406],{"start":403,"end":404,"type":187,"data":405},61,67,{"link_type":76,"url":279,"target":190},{"start":403,"end":404,"type":183},{"type":67,"text":408,"spans":409,"direction":70},"Check out our international courier services to learn more about sending overseas to 200+ destinations.",[410,415],{"start":411,"end":412,"type":187,"data":413},14,44,{"link_type":76,"url":414,"target":190},"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services",{"start":411,"end":412,"type":183},{"questionTitle":417,"questionBody":418},"How reliable is Evri’s tracking?",[419,422,425],{"type":67,"text":420,"spans":421,"direction":70},"When it comes to keeping track of your parcels, we know of those familiar frustrations from traditional services all too well. ",[],{"type":67,"text":423,"spans":424,"direction":70},"Whether you’re a customer or a recipient, use our tracking tool for end-to-end tracking and options to divert your delivery. ",[],{"type":67,"text":426,"spans":427,"direction":70},"Simply enter your tracking number on our tracking page to see where your parcel is on its journey.",[428,432],{"start":283,"end":429,"type":187,"data":430},54,{"link_type":76,"url":431,"target":190},"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":283,"end":429,"type":183},{"questionTitle":434,"questionBody":435},"Can I buy cover for my parcel?",[436,439,448],{"type":67,"text":437,"spans":438,"direction":70},"We offer free cover up to £20 on most items to keep your parcels protected every step of the way. ",[],{"type":67,"text":440,"spans":441,"direction":70},"Unlike Royal Mail, you can scale your cover to your needs with Evri and up to the value of £999 - starting from just 1p extra. For more information, see our guide on parcel cover.",[442,447],{"start":443,"end":444,"type":187,"data":445},166,178,{"link_type":76,"url":446,"target":366},"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fparcel-cover",{"start":443,"end":444,"type":183},{"type":67,"text":449,"spans":450,"direction":70},"Restricted items and Postable parcels aren’t covered. Check our non-compensation list for a full breakdown of what these include.",[451,456,457,462],{"start":452,"end":453,"type":187,"data":454},21,37,{"link_type":76,"url":455,"target":190},"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fpostable",{"start":452,"end":453,"type":183},{"start":458,"end":459,"type":187,"data":460},64,85,{"link_type":76,"url":461,"target":190},"evri-vs-royal-mail.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send",{"start":458,"end":463,"type":183},86,{"questionTitle":465,"questionBody":466},"What is the cheapest way to send a parcel in the UK with Evri?",[467],{"type":67,"text":468,"spans":469,"direction":70},"The cheapest way to send a parcel in the UK is via ParcelShop-to-ParcelShop, rather than arranging a collection or home delivery. Sending from ParcelShop to ParcelShop helps keep costs lower. Evri’s ParcelShop delivery starts from just a few pounds for small parcels, making it one of the most cost-effective options.",[],{"questionTitle":471,"questionBody":472},"Is Evri part of Royal Mail?",[473],{"type":67,"text":474,"spans":475,"direction":70},"No, Evri is not part of Royal Mail. They are separate delivery companies with their own networks and services.",[],{"questionTitle":477,"questionBody":478},"Is Evri cheaper than Royal Mail?",[479],{"type":67,"text":480,"spans":481,"direction":70},"Pricing depends on the parcel size, weight and service selected. To compare costs and find the best option for your parcel, please refer to the pricing tables on this page.",[],{"title":483},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$535a3cd7-4c0a-47c5-af7a-8dda9059526a","frequently_asked_questions",{"variation":487,"version":26,"items":488,"primary":489,"id":508,"slice_type":509,"slice_label":45},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":490,"show_premium_logo":21,"label":45,"label_theme":491,"titleH2":492,"bodyText":493,"image":497,"rightImage":39,"buttonText":368,"buttonLink":503,"buttonDataGtmTrack":506,"primary_button_external":21,"button_secondary":507,"secondary_button_external":21},"standard","Core","Did you know we offer Business Accounts?",[494],{"type":67,"text":495,"spans":496,"direction":70},"Whether you run a side hustle or full-time business, we have everything you need. Check out our different account options to suit you.",[],{"dimensions":498,"alt":499,"copyright":45,"url":500,"id":501,"edit":502},{"width":53,"height":210},"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office taking a phone call and using their laptop to book 